---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
    title="Portfolio"
    description="Portfolio"
    withHeader={true}
    withFooter={false}
>
    <div class="text-center my-10">
        <h1 class="text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight">Deni Susanto</h1>
        <p class="text-sm tracking-wide text-brand-foreground/70">
            A self-taught cybersecurity enthusiast.
        </p>
    </div>
    <div class="space-y-5">
        <div>
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight">Summary</h2>
            <p>
                A high school graduate with a strong interest in Cybersecurity,
                Linux, and Technology in general. Self-taught and prefer
                hands-on learning. I'm based in Tulungagung, East Java,
                Indonesia. Currently, I'm looking for opportunities to grow my
                skills and knowledge.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div>
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight">Technical Skills</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>Linux</li>
                <li>Python</li>
                <li>Go</li>
                <li>Bash</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight">Soft Skills</h2>
            <p>I'm still working to improve myself.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight">Experience</h2>
            <p>
                I don't have formal work experience, but I have spent time
                learning through hands-on projects and experiments.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div>
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight">Education</h2>
            <div>
                <p class="font-bold">SMA Negeri 1 Campurdarat</p>
                <p class="text-sm text-brand-foreground/70">High School</p>
                <p>graduated 2026</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div>
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight">Projects</h2>
            <p>
                see all my projects on <a
                    class="underline underline-offset-4"
                    href="https://github.com/avoidofme?tab=repositories"
                    >my github</a
                >
            </p>
            <div>
                <div>
                    <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold">lmd</h3>
                    <p class="flex gap-2 text-sm text-brand-foreground/70">
                        <span>go</span><span>docker</span><span>ansible</span
                        ><span>github actions</span>
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        this is personal project where i made simple API, the
                        purpose is learning DevOps where i use techs like
                        docker, ansible, github actions.
                    </p>
                    <a
                        class="underline underline-offset-4"
                        href="https://github.com/avoidofme/lmd">source</a
                    >
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold">gtps</h3>
                    <p class="flex gap-2 text-sm text-brand-foreground/70">
                        <span>go</span><span>docker</span><span>ansible</span
                        ><span>github actions</span>
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        this is personal project where i made simple TCP port
                        scanner utilizing go builtin coroutine 'goroutine' and
                        channel to maximize the the potential which can scan
                        1000+ ports in seconds.
                    </p>
                    <a
                        class="underline underline-offset-4"
                        href="https://github.com/avoidofme/gtps">source</a
                    >
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div>
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight">Certifications</h2>
            <p>
                I don't think certificates do much but since i only have minor
                one i tried searching free certs, and got two worth mentioning.
            </p>
            <ul>
                <li>
                    <strong>Python </strong> I got this from freecodecamp.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong>Introduction to Cybersecurity </strong> i got this from
                    cisco networking academy.
                </li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight">Contact</h2>
            <p>
                Like alway you can always contact me through discord or email,
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</Layout>
